{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17822","headline":"失题 · 杨巨源","name":"失题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何事慰朝夕，不踰诗酒情。\n山河空道路，蕃汉共刀兵。\n礼乐新朝市，园林旧弟兄。\n向风一点泪，塞晚暮江平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}